# The app owner's Google OAuth client id — baked into the build so every
# visitor can sign in with their own Gmail (their data lands in THEIR Drive).
# Create it at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# (OAuth client ID, type "Web application") with authorized JavaScript origins:
#   http://localhost:5175        (local dev)
#   https://<your-user>.github.io (GitHub Pages)
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
